cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt these lab materials, please cite them as below."
title: "Information System Security: hands-on offensive & defensive labs"
abstract: >-
  Lab instructions and environment for the course Information System Security
  (Sigurnost informacijskih sustava) at Aspira University of Applied Sciences,
  Split. Each lab pairs an offensive technique with a defensive fix: password
  hashing and cracking, network traffic interception and detection, web attacks
  (injection, XSS, broken access control, JWT), exploitation and privilege
  escalation, a red/blue capstone, and AI security (prompt injection) — run on
  Kali Linux with Docker targets.
authors:
